      "content": "wait really?? i mean a clot sounds super intense lol. i was thinking maybe i just need to ice it and keep it elevated for a day or two? i'm kinda busy with work right now and don't really think i need an ER visit for just some swelling. do you think i can just wait it out and see if it goes down by tomorrow morning?",
